/// {@template flutter.widgets.navigator.Route.requestFocus}
/// If [requestFocus] is not provided, the value of [Navigator.requestFocus] is
/// used instead.
/// {@endtemplate}™@™P␀␀™Y™`␀␀™~™t™‰™€™Œ™’™Ÿ™ ™·™©™¹››'␀␀›š›ª␀␀:H␀␀¡gO¡„␀¡š¡§¡¯¡¨¡®¡°¡µ¡±À␀C³3À␀CÇ␀À␀C×À␀CàÀ␀CãÀ␀CáÀ␀CâÀ␀CäÀ␀CåÀ␀Cë7À␀Cÿ␀À␀DÀ␀DÀ␀DÀ␀DÀ␀DÀ␀D À␀D!ššÏ€¬/// When the route state is updated, request focus if the current route is at the top.
